TI  - Synergistic association between cytochrome bd-encoded Proteiniphilum and reactive oxygen species (ROS)-scavenging methanogens in microaerobic-anaerobic digestion of lignocellulosic biomass
AU  - Wu, Zhuoying
AU  - Nguyen, Duc
AU  - Lam, Theo Y.C.
AU  - Zhuang, Huichuan
AU  - Shrestha, Shilva
AU  - Raskin, Lutgarde
